  "translation": "Bilong i no gat rimemba bilong saveman wantaim fulumen olgeta taim — bihain tru long ol de i kam, olgeta bai olgeta man i lusim ⟨em⟩; na olsem wanem saveman bai i dai wantaim fulumen!",
